[{"id":"transparent-loan","title":"ClearPath personal loan","subtitle":"Relatively transparent · fixed rate","description":"A fully synthetic agreement with explicit amounts, a fixed rate, modest fees, and a stated grace period.","filename":"SYNTHETIC-clearpath-personal-loan.txt","text":"SYNTHETIC DEMONSTRATION DOCUMENT — NOT A REAL OFFER\nClearPath Mutual Bank\nPERSONAL LOAN AGREEMENT\n\nThis synthetic personal loan agreement is between ClearPath Mutual Bank and the borrower.\n\nPrincipal amount: $12,000.00.\nLoan term: 36 months.\nRepayments are due in monthly instalments on the first business day of each month.\n\nThe fixed annual interest rate is 7.20% per annum. The interest rate is fixed for the entire agreement.\nThe effective annual rate is 7.44%, as explicitly disclosed for this synthetic example.\n\nAccount maintenance fee: $3.00 per month.\nProcessing fee: $75.00 one-time at origination.\nThere are no administrative fees under this agreement.\n\nA late payment fee of $15.00 applies if a payment remains unpaid after a grace period of 10 calendar days.\nEarly repayment penalty: 0%. The borrower may repay early without an early repayment charge.\n\nOptional payment protection insurance costs $6.00 per month and may be cancelled by the borrower.\nDomestic bank transfers from the repayment account have a transaction fee of $0.25 per transaction.\n\nThe final repayment includes any remaining principal and accrued ordinary interest. The bank will provide a complete amortisation schedule upon request.\n\nThis document is synthetic and created only to demonstrate document analysis. It is not financial advice or an actual financial product."},{"id":"fee-heavy-loan","title":"HarbourStone consumer credit","subtitle":"Multiple additional fees · synthetic","description":"A fully synthetic fee-heavy agreement with recurring maintenance, mandatory insurance, penalties, and discretionary charges.","filename":"SYNTHETIC-harbourstone-consumer-credit.txt","text":"SYNTHETIC DEMONSTRATION DOCUMENT — NOT A REAL OFFER\nHarbourStone Finance\nPERSONAL LOAN AGREEMENT AND FEE SCHEDULE\n\nThis synthetic credit agreement is issued by HarbourStone Finance.\n\nLoan principal: EUR 8,500.00.\nRepayment period: 48 months.\nThe borrower must make monthly payments on the 15th day of each month.\n\nThe annual interest rate is 9.40% per annum. The interest rate is fixed for 48 months.\n\nLoan processing fee: 3.00% of principal, one-time and deducted from loan proceeds.\nDocumentation and administrative fee: EUR 120.00 one-time at signing.\nMonthly account maintenance fee: EUR 11.90 per month for keeping the account open.\nMandatory credit protection insurance premium: EUR 14.50 per month throughout the agreement.\n\nA transfer commission of 0.80% applies to each transfer from the loan servicing account.\nAn additional handling fee of EUR 4.00 applies per withdrawal at a branch.\n\nLate payment penalty: 6.00% of the overdue instalment, plus a default charge of 0.08% per day on the overdue balance.\nEarly repayment fee: 2.50% of the outstanding principal when early settlement occurs.\n\nThe provider may introduce other charges from time to time at its sole discretion. Additional service fees may apply as determined by the provider.\n\nA payment holiday may be granted at our discretion; interest accrues during any payment holiday and the repayment schedule may be extended.\n\nAll names, values, and clauses in this document are synthetic and provided solely for software testing and financial-literacy education."},{"id":"variable-loan","title":"AsterPeak variable-rate loan","subtitle":"Variable interest · early repayment","description":"A fully synthetic agreement with benchmark-linked interest, adjustment conditions, early settlement charges, and a final balloon payment.","filename":"SYNTHETIC-asterpeak-variable-loan.txt","text":"SYNTHETIC DEMONSTRATION DOCUMENT — NOT A REAL OFFER\nAsterPeak Capital Finance\nVARIABLE-RATE PERSONAL LOAN AGREEMENT\n\nThis synthetic agreement is between AsterPeak Capital Finance and the customer.\n\nPrincipal amount: $20,000.00.\nContract duration: 60 months.\nRepayment frequency: monthly instalments.\n\nThe initial annual interest rate is 5.75% per annum.\nThis is a variable rate. The interest rate equals the six-month SOFR reference rate plus a margin of 2.75%.\nThe provider may adjust the interest rate every six months following a benchmark review. Rate changes may increase or decrease monthly instalments.\nThe agreement does not state a maximum interest-rate cap.\n\nOrigination fee: $200.00 one-time at origination.\nAccount management fee: $5.50 per month.\n\nEarly repayment penalty: 3.00% of the amount repaid early during the first 24 months.\nAfter 24 months, the early settlement fee is 1.00% of the amount repaid early.\nLate payment fee: $35.00 for each instalment more than 5 days late.\n\nA balloon payment of $2,500.00 is due at maturity in addition to the final ordinary monthly instalment.\nBorrowers must maintain a repayment account with the provider for the full contract duration.\n\nOther costs payable on demand may apply at our discretion without notice.\n\nThis document is entirely synthetic. Benchmark names are used for educational illustration only and this is not an actual offer or financial recommendation."}]